  "duration_seconds": 79.6,
  "cues": [
    {
      "cue_id": "EP008-C01",
      "text": "距离血月降临，还剩四十天。屋里的水、粮、灯都备齐了，只有医疗箱，一直是空的。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/speed1p3/EP008-C01.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "028e993d7c9088edb5eb61734db257b9e6e975a83c6ade90326bdbd68f64b60e",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.6074166666666665,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 199,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 0,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/EP008-C01.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "03d3f94b0a2b6c4aaa5954c4eed1f3d44ed44ba996aca703cfa9868f66916cdc",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.6,
      "sample_count": 317156
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP008-C02",
      "text": "药店的店员把我的清单推回来，说，这些药得凭处方买。他朝门外一指，今天有义诊医生，你问她。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/speed1p3/EP008-C02.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "5b4f88e27fcfc8a2589ed90c73614cdfc62df5cabd6fc20a6f043e09837361f9",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.002104166666666,
      "start_frame": 202,
      "end_frame": 413,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/EP008-C02.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "e35f15780c8657652cf3176e8f0956d85e6612bb8473aa7ac6f9151a9160b4ff",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.1,
      "sample_count": 336101
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP008-C03",
      "text": "义诊摊前，一个女医生正在擦桌子，擦了一遍，又擦一遍。胸牌上写着，许知意，市第一医院急诊科。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/speed1p3/EP008-C03.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "10a6121e591c26dbdcdb300668d1186bc7eb4da5252a4a28ee4455ca44d432b5",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.0658125,
      "start_frame": 416,
      "end_frame": 658,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/EP008-C03.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "0803f5c2cde647e4a6442c3288dc0e1399572c9b8124f604d20ae7ffa055fa3a",
      "source_duration_seconds": 10.5,
      "sample_count": 387159
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP008-C04",
      "text": "她用纸巾，隔着捏起我的清单，从头看到尾，眉头越皱越紧。抗生素，缝合线，止血带，碘伏……你是想开战地医院？\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/speed1p3/EP008-C04.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "66fb4edd91e594e46bab6c96c884b8d2cb772d448570c491396d4be31a128a5a",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.610958333333333,
      "start_frame": 661,
      "end_frame": 920,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/EP008-C04.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "d9aa4a5d483c4cb0bf40b5dc977ab36908cf5457a50d95d140dd1a95b610eb28",
      "source_duration_seconds": 11.2,
      "sample_count": 413326
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP008-C05",
      "text": "我说，我喜欢户外。她抬眼看我，说，驴友，不需要三十副缝合包。我准备好的理由，全咽了回去。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/speed1p3/EP008-C05.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "faa2ee67f83a9801736e9e81293d497eea6d75979756c9110ac7b8c7e724084d",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.3179375,
      "start_frame": 923,
      "end_frame": 1143,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/EP008-C05.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "3fe31f2aeb20f12347c929864e52a3a90febbff4df3b80a74d3ccf0633fa5459",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.5,
      "sample_count": 351261
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP008-C06",
      "text": "她问我，你在为很多人准备？多少人？我说，现在两个。以后，我也不知道。越多越好。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/speed1p3/EP008-C06.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "94f1d893ba053a3f8a77f854fd93e29fd05190d8bb43df3cff6a92f1f04714be",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.609229166666666,
      "start_frame": 1146,
      "end_frame": 1345,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/EP008-C06.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "7e1024cfcade0858aecd238c292f0fdd24fab44b44d1299f7d051239abdd5fc0",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.6,
      "sample_count": 317243
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP008-C07",
      "text": "她沉默了一会儿，没有给我开一整箱药。她把清单折到背面，告诉我，哪些现在可以买，哪些得带着具体的人，走正规诊疗。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/speed1p3/EP008-C07.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "93ede6249dce2a34e6800ca3361e2f5e92ad6128fec0672c2cb892abc8e96a76",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.605416666666667,
      "start_frame": 1348,
      "end_frame": 1607,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/EP008-C07.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "19bfaf1a8f6282499d55c03b106348d06805f17dabd5db492a81287b97397332",
      "source_duration_seconds": 11.2,
      "sample_count": 413060
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP008-C08",
      "text": "她一边说，一边把桌上的纱布盒，按大小摆齐。我看着，有点想笑。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/speed1p3/EP008-C08.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "bc0cff550c459d89d526a9c872e3a7c5afbc5e14f97620376ab7f8855c1167ea",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.168125,
      "start_frame": 1610,
      "end_frame": 1766,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/EP008-C08.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "bc1aed406a82fc00f6f3f1d9432b68eacdeae26f78aafafc984cb0c0b1526785",
      "source_duration_seconds": 6.7,
      "sample_count": 248070
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP008-C09",
      "text": "我谢了她。她说，我不信你的理由。但我信，你手上的数字。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/speed1p3/EP008-C09.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "130f0060c15c90338069b56a8c8399b00abfd8303cb262305b11ee075b3a8141",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 4.4323958333333335,
      "start_frame": 1769,
      "end_frame": 1902,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/EP008-C09.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "348943d647cbe160669ff3ff13f7154e424a288a3bd2605842d700f33d41b9c8",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.793406,
      "sample_count": 212755
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP008-C10",
      "text": "她从白大褂口袋里抽出一张名片，在背面写下号码。真有那天，我在市一院急诊科。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/speed1p3/EP008-C10.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "7b9b847fa65e51049b101b6af42e2e7ff1699bed6e27c480a8da032bc9686f98",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.8558125,
      "start_frame": 1905,
      "end_frame": 2081,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/EP008-C10.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "2263fff2d5840b33ae923e774cd10c1c6641096c8d0ab4bc1c3cd3eee5027379",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.6,
      "sample_count": 281079
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP008-C11",
      "text": "回家后，夏凛把袋子里的纱布和碘伏，按数量收进医疗箱。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/speed1p3/EP008-C11.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "c80d27a4b4a96248be88d38e73c6d66bbd9edd7e96570f8f4c3b7f57d0d4c7b6",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 4.699666666666666,
      "start_frame": 2084,
      "end_frame": 2225,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/EP008-C11.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "1c4e240d8184c18e1a36cfac7e1706cb60a2f78afc5471df85151b3890697a13",
      "source_duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "sample_count": 225584
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP008-C12",
      "text": "那张名片，我夹进了采购本，就在当初画出来的，那两栏空白的名字旁边。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/speed1p3/EP008-C12.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "955b4763cd665520bfca97527ab6d3466247e4a78d76ea5fc4f2fcb3a017c709",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.307145833333333,
      "start_frame": 2228,
      "end_frame": 2388,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP008/audio/EP008-C12.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "843ca53f3a7cf9a7bc50e205c0f73980cfe5214ee4f3c82630a8a4ba6b234529",
      "source_duration_seconds": 6.9,
      "sample_count": 254743
    }
  ],
